      ],
      "source": "https://www.milledgevilleil.net/history.html",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The original mill was torn down in 1908, but its legacy lives in Old Mill Road, the former Main Street of Old Town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
